      "writtenOn": "2022-11-11T21:24:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess not, since the docs for `cc_binary` `srcs` states that `.h`, `.hpp`, `.hxx`, `.hh`, `.inc`, `.inl`, and `.H` will be treated as header files and header files explicitly will not be compiled (with no option to do so, apparently). The unfortunate failures of abstractions.",
      "parentUuid": "de37b02c_f1305ba5",
      "revId": "b1d06473c075fb1dd0866aa757660c212e820a73",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
